  "description": "Click here and download the Knitted Christmas Gift Box STL Set · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Create a cozy festive display with this beautiful Knitted Christmas Gift Box STL Set, featuring 3 unique present designs inspired by chunky yarn, braided rope, and cable-knit textures.\n\nEach gift box features a rounded square silhouette with deeply detailed knitted panels, raised ribbon bands, and a sculpted bow on top. The three variations include charming seasonal details such as holly leaves and berries, a classic wrapped present design, and a hanging Christmas star ornament, giving every model its own distinctive look while keeping the collection visually coordinated.\n\nThe detailed cable-knit patterns create the appearance of soft handmade yarn while maintaining a solid decorative form suitable for 3D printing. These models are ideal for Christmas tabletop displays, shelf décor, mantels, holiday centerpieces, winter scenes, and festive gift arrangements.\n\nThe models can be colored using Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, OrcaSlicer, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize the gift boxes, ribbons, bows, holly leaves, berries, stars, and knitted sections with your preferred Christmas colors.\n\nIncluded: 3 decorative knitted-style Christmas Gift Box models.\n\nDigital Product: STL files for 3D printing only. No physical gift boxes or photography props are included.\n\nProduct Tags — 45 One-Word Tags",
